<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Projects - Notes From Over There</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Projects by Ismail Fayed">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="main-nav">
       <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">Notes From Over There</a>
            <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu">&#9776;</button>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/index.html">Home</a>
                <a href="/english/index.html">English</a>
                <a href="/arabic/index.html">العربية</a>
                <a href="/blog/index.html" class="active">Blog</a>
                <a href="/about.html">About</a>
                <a href="/portfolio.pdf" target="_blank">portfolio</a>
                <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
                 <a href="https://instagram.com/notes_fromoverthere" target="_blank" class="https://www.instagram.com/notes_fromoverthere/">IG</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="category-header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Projects</h1>
            <p class="category-description">A selection of curatorial and academic projects</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="category-content">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="reviews-grid">
                <!-- Project 1 -->
                <article class="review-card">
                    <div class="review-thumbnail">
                        <img src="../../assets/thumbnails/project-thumb-01.jpg" alt="Project 1 Thumbnail" class="thumbnail-image">
                    </div>
                    <h2>Àsìkò Art School 2025 - Cairo Edition</h2>
                    <p class="review-excerpt">The 2025 edition marks Àsìkò’s first time in an Arabic-speaking country, taking place in Cairo, Egypt from 27 April to 25 May, 2025, hosted by ARD Art Institution. The 2025 edition, held under the theme “Holding Memory”, brings together artists and curators for a month-long journey of research, exchange, and collective growth.</p>
                    <a href="project-01.html" class="read-more-btn">Read more</a>
                </article>

                <!-- Project 2 -->
                <article class="review-card">
                    <div class="review-thumbnail">
                        <img src="../../assets/thumbnails/project-thumb-02.jpg" alt="Project 2 Thumbnail" class="thumbnail-image">
                    </div>
                    <h2>Hamel: Translations, Migrations and Rituals of Care</h2>
                    <p class="review-excerpt">HAMEL. DEEP TIME RIVER, A performance by the YouYou Group, part of De Singel’s Festival CARTA</p>
                    <a href="project-02.html" class="read-more-btn">Read more</a>
                </article>

                <!-- Project 3 -->
                <article class="review-card">
                    <div class="review-thumbnail">
                        <img src="../../assets/thumbnails/project-thumb-03.jpg" alt="Project 3 Thumbnail" class="thumbnail-image">
                    </div>
                    <h2>Tomatoes, Fibreglass and the Persistence of the Human</h2>
                    <p class="review-excerpt">Textual commission, For magazine and exhibition space, publication No. 4 Local Origins, Propaganda, Persistence 2023 (as part of the exhibition “The six hundred seventy four forms and a dragon” by Yasmine El Meleegy)  </p>
                    <a href="project-03.html" class="read-more-btn">Read more</a>
                </article>

                <!-- Project 4 -->
                <article class="review-card">
                    <div class="review-thumbnail">
                        <img src="../../assets/thumbnails/project-thumb-04.jpg" alt="Project 4 Thumbnail" class="thumbnail-image">
                    </div>
                    <h2>On Rending Bodies Invisible</h2>
                    <p class="review-excerpt">“Bodies, un-protected” was initiated by Mousonturm and curator Sandra Noeth, the text is a contribution to the publication of the project</p>
                    <a href="project-04.html" class="read-more-btn">Read more</a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="main-footer">
        <div class="container">
            <p>&copy; 2022 Ismail Fayed. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p><a href="../index.html">Notes From Over There</a></p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <style>
        /* General styles from index-2.html and teaching-index-streamlined */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Noto Sans', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background: #FDE5D6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        .main-nav {
            background: rgba(253, 229, 214, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: 1rem 0;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
            direction: ltr;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-logo {
            color: #333;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            color: #333;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: opacity 0.3s;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover,
        .nav-links a.active {
            opacity: 0.7;
        }

        /* Header */
        .category-header {
            padding: 6rem 0 3rem 0;
            margin-top: 60px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .category-header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .category-description {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #666;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Main Content */
        .category-content {
            padding: 4rem 0;
        }

        .reviews-grid { /* Reused for project cards */
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .review-card { /* Reused for project cards */
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            border-left: 4px solid #FA8072;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .review-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        }

        .review-thumbnail {
            width: 97px;
            height: 97px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .thumbnail-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }

        .review-card h2 {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.3;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .review-excerpt {
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .read-more-btn {
            background: #FA8072;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.56rem 1.04rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .read-more-btn:hover {
            background: #E55B4D;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .main-footer {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            color: #333;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }

        .main-footer a {
            color: #333;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .main-footer a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .menu-toggle {
          display: none;
          background: none;
          border: none;
          font-size: 1.5rem;
          cursor: pointer;
          color: #333;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .menu-toggle {
               display: block;
            }

            .nav-container {
                padding: 0 1rem;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 1rem;
                justify-content: center;
                margin-top: 1rem;
            }

            .nav-links.active {
                display: flex;
            }

            .category-header {
                padding: 5rem 0 2rem 0;
                margin-top: 120px;
            }

            .category-header h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .reviews-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 0 1rem;
            }

            .review-card {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .category-header h1 {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }

            .review-card {
                padding: 1rem;
            }

            .review-card h2 {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }

            .nav-links {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
                gap: 0.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
    <script>
        const toggle = document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');
        const navLinks = document.querySelector('.nav-links');

        toggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
            navLinks.classList.toggle('active');
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
